The datasets contained in the `data/` directory of this repository — including
`data/puns.json` and all files under `data/original/`, `data/pair_controlled/`,
and `data/max_cross_split/` — are derived from the Puntuguese corpus:

    Puntuguese: A Corpus of Puns in Portuguese with Micro-edits.
    Marcio Lima Inacio, Gabriela Wick-Pedro, Renata Ramisch, Luis Espirito
    Santo, Xiomara S. Q. Chacon, Roney Santos, Rogerio Sousa, Rafael Anchieta,
    and Hugo Goncalo Oliveira. LREC-COLING 2024, pp. 13332-13343.
    https://aclanthology.org/2024.lrec-main.1167/
    Corpus: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Superar/Puntuguese

